WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:07.006
HEY, DON LEMON -- NO, SHOULD I
SAY GOOD MORNING, DON LEMON.

00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:14.681
&gt;&gt; I DON'T HAVE ANY IDEA WHAT
YOU ARE TALKING ABOUT.

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:20.120
&gt;&gt; MAYBE YOU ARE ON LONDON TIME.
THERE IS BIG NEWS OVER HERE.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:23.256
&gt;&gt; I'M EXHAUSTED.
I JUST GOT BACK TODAY.

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:29.562
WHAT A PLAN THIS BEING ON THE
PLANE WHILE THIS HAPPENED AND MY

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:33.099
PHONE WAS HEATED UP ALL DAY.
LET ME JUST SAY IT'S BITTERSWEET

00:00:33.099 --> 00:00:36.336
FOR ME BECAUSE I WORK WITH THE
BEST TEAM IN THIS BUILDING, ONE

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:39.906
OF THE BEST TEAMS IN THIS
BUSINESS AND WE BUILT THIS SHOW

00:00:39.906 --> 00:00:43.243
OUT OF NOTHING.
THIS SHOW WAS NOT SUPPOSED TO

00:00:43.243 --> 00:00:46.646
EXIST.
AND BECAUSE I HAVE SUCH

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:51.484
FANTASTIC PRODUCERS AND WRITERS
AND MARIA WHO IS MY EXECUTIVE

00:00:51.484 --> 00:00:54.254
PRODUCER AND MY EXECUTIVE
PRODUCER, PHILLIP, THE PEOPLE

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:59.926
THAT WRITE THINGS THAT COME OUT
OF MY MOUTH, THE THINGS THAT

00:00:59.926 --> 00:01:05.832
MAKE SENSE.
SUSAN IS GREAT AND OTHER SENIOR

00:01:05.832 --> 00:01:08.301
PRODUCER ALYSSA WELLDON.
I JUST HAVE REALLY WONDERFUL

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:11.404
PEOPLE WHO KNOW ME.
IT'S LIKE A MIND MELD.

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:15.775
BUT I WAS PRESENTED WITH AN
OPPORTUNITY THAT I CAN'T PASS UP

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:27.520
AT THIS NETWORK, AND WE HAVE A
NEW BOSS, WHO IS A MORNING SHOW

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:34.761
E EXMPREARIO.
AND HE WANTS A SHOW TO KICK OFF

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:38.264
THINGS EVERY DAY.
AND SAYING HE MOVED ME -- HE

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:41.768
ASKED ME AND I SAID YES.
I COULD HAVE SAID NO.

00:01:41.768 --> 00:01:46.940
THIS IS MY SHOW.
I HAVE A CONTRACT FOR THIS SHOW.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:50.643
I DECIDED I WOULD TAKE HIM UP ON
THAT.

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:59.352
THIS IS NOT SOMEONE SAYING YOU
MUST MOVE TO THE RIGHT DON LEMON

00:01:59.352 --> 00:02:02.255
AND GIVE SO MUCH OF YOUR
PERSPECTIVE.

00:02:02.255 --> 00:02:06.593
THAT IS NOT REAL.
THIS IS FODDER FOR TWITTER.

00:02:06.593 --> 00:02:07.727
THIS IS AN OPPORTUNITY.
THIS IS A PROMOTION.

00:02:07.727 --> 00:02:12.065
THIS IS AN OPPORTUNITY FOR ME TO
CREATE SOMETHING AROUND ME AND I

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:17.470
GET TO WORK WITH TWO GREAT
LADIES WHO YOU KNOW, POPPY

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.607
HARLOW, WHO I HAVE KNOWN FOR
DECADES.

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:23.409
I KNEW HER CHILDREN AND HUSBAND.
AND KAITLYN COLLINS, SAME THING,

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:27.480
WE HAVE BEEN FRIENDS SINCE
KAITLYN HAS BEEN AT THE NETWORK.

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:29.349
IT'S REALLY GREAT.
THE ONLY THING IS THE BOSS LAUGH

00:02:29.349 --> 00:02:32.485
AND SAID I'M GOING TO HAVE TO
PUT SOME EXTRA MONEY IN THE

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:36.055
BUDGET TO HAVE SOMEONE COME OUT
TO YOUR HOUSE AND WAKE YOU UP

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:39.259
EVERY MORNING.
SINCE I HAVE BEEN IN THIS

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:41.761
BUSINESS SINCE THE 1990s,
SERIOUSLY, I HAVE ONLY BEEN ON

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:43.696
THE NIGHT SHIFT.
THE ONLY TIME I WAS ON THE

00:02:43.696 --> 00:02:46.599
MORNING SHIFT WAS A FILL IN,
WHEN I WAS FILLING IN ON THE

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:50.103
TODAY SHOW OR WEEKEND TODAY OR
SOMETHING LIKE THAT, EVEN ON THE

00:02:50.103 --> 00:02:51.871
MORNING SHOW HERE.
THAT IS THE ONLY TIME I HAVE

00:02:51.871 --> 00:02:55.675
EVER -- THAT HASN'T BEEN THAT
MUCH, SO IT'S GOING TO TAKE SOME

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:59.479
GETTING USED TO.
&gt;&gt; I TELL YOU, I KNOW TWO

00:02:59.479 --> 00:03:04.550
THINGS.
NOBODY PUTS BABY IN THE CORNER

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:06.219
AND NOBODY DICTATES ANYTHING TO
DON LEMON.

00:03:06.219 --> 00:03:10.423
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.
&gt;&gt; I WAIT UP AND STAY UP EVERY

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:15.128
NIGHT FOR DON LEMON, I'M HAPPY
TO GET UP IN THE MORNING.

00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:16.629
I CAN'T WAIT.
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU.

00:03:16.629 --> 00:03:20.133
WHEN I STARTED DOING THIS, IT
WAS EIGHT AND A HALF YEARS AGO

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:27.106
AND THEY WERE DOING PILOT --
WHAT ARE WE GOING TO DO WITH

00:03:27.106 --> 00:03:28.908
PRIME TIME?
AND OUR OLD BOSS SAID GO DO IT.

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:32.645
AND IT WAS THE ONLY -- HE SAID
THE ONLY PILOT THAT MATTERS IS

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:35.681
THE ONE ON THE AIR.
SO YOU GO AT IT.

00:03:35.681 --> 00:03:41.321
AND THEN IT BECAME CNN TONIGHT
AND THEN CNN TONIGHT WITH DON

00:03:41.321 --> 00:03:44.490
LEMON AND THEN DON LEMON
TONIGHT.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.893
I'M HAPPY IT IS A SUCCESSFUL
SHOW.

00:03:46.893 --> 00:03:50.296
IT HAS BEEN 8 AND A HALF YEARS.
I WANT TO TRY SOMETHING ELSE.

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:54.200
WHAT IS LIFE WITHOUT RISKS.
&gt;&gt; I'M SO EXCITED FOR YOU.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:59.439
WE ARE ALL BEHIND YOU.
IT WILL BE WONDERFUL FOR YOU.

00:03:59.439 --> 00:04:02.909
YOU, KAITLYN AND POPPY.
I AM TELLING YOU, THOUGH, WE

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:08.147
HAVE ALL BEEN WATCHING YOU ON --
IN ENGLAND TIME, YOU ARE GOOD IN

00:04:08.147 --> 00:04:11.951
THE MORNING, KID.
&gt;&gt; OH, THANK YOU, YOUNG LADY.

00:04:11.951 --> 00:04:16.222
THE NAME OF THE SHOW WILL BE DO
AND K POP.

00:04:16.222 --> 00:04:21.961
&gt;&gt; I WILL NEED ONE MORE FOCUS
GROUP, JUST ONE.

00:04:21.961 --> 00:04:23.763
TAKE CARE.
&gt;&gt; YOU ARE THE BEST.

00:04:23.763 --> 00:04:26.366
SEE YOU TOMORROW.
&gt;&gt; TAKE CARE.

